      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING DAYTONA (4) has an excellent record over this journey having never missed the placings in five starts, including two wins and three placings. Placed last time (19.92) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 2.25 lengths. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. SAIF (1) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Typhoon Pablo (19.96) in a Restricted WIN. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature. ANTI VENOM (7) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Scored over 390m at Q Lakeside last time in a Grade 4/5 (21.67). Form here at the trip sound including six wins. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Can measure up again. EXTREME GRUNT (3) is one of the chances after a minor prize at this track and distance last time.",
